# ---- FrameSync web client environment ----
# OAuth 2.0 Client ID from Google Cloud Console (Credentials -> OAuth client ID
# -> Web application). Must match GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in server/.env — the server
# verifies the ID token's audience against it.
#
# Add this app's origin (http://localhost:5173 for dev) to the client's
# "Authorised JavaScript origins". Leave blank to hide the Google button.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
